# Delivery, every fifteen minutes.
#
# The tightest SLA in the product is four hours (critical), so anything
# faster than this is noise — and the job is idempotent, so a missed run
# costs nothing but latency. It never re-sends, so overlapping runs are
# safe too.
#
#   crontab -e   and paste, with the paths corrected:
#
*/15 * * * * cd /path/to/ulip-platform && ULIP_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:8787 ULIP_APP_URL=https://ulip-platform.vercel.app /usr/local/bin/npx tsx scripts/deliver.ts >> /tmp/ulix-deliver.log 2>&1

# Check it is working:
#   tail -f /tmp/ulix-deliver.log
#
# Decide without sending, any time:
#   npm run deliver:dry
